!**************************************************************************************************************************************************************************
! Reaction Mechanism of butane isomers in CHEMKIN format
! Title: Experimental and kinetic modeling investigation on pyrolysis and 
!         combustion of n-butane and i-butane at various pressures
! Authors: Wei Li, Guoqing Wang, Yuyang Li, Tianyu Li, Yan Zhang, Chuangchuang Cao, Jiabiao Zou, Chung K. Law
! Corresponding author: Yuyang Li, Chung K. Law
!**************************************************************************************************************************************************************************
!----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
ELEMENTS
C H N AR HE
O
END
!-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
SPECIES

!
!C0
 AR        N2          H          H2         HE
 O         OH         H2O        HO2        H2O2       O2                                    

!C1                                                     
 C         CH          CH2        CH2*       CH3        CH4       
 CO        CO2         CH2O       HCO        CH2OH      CH3O     
 CH3OH     HOCHO       HOCH2O

!C2                                                     
 C2H       C2H2        H2CC       C2H3       C2H4       C2H5      C2H6        
 C2H5OH  C2H5O   C2H3OH   CH3CHO  CH2OCH2   CH3CO   CH2CHO   CH2OCH   CH2COH  CH2CO  HCCO   C2O
 CH3CHOH   HCCOH   HCCHOH      ! no sub-mech      

!C3                                                     
 H2CCC C3H2      C3H3        PC3H4      AC3H4      CC3H4      AC3H5     TC3H5       SC3H5      C3H6       NC3H7      IC3H7     C3H8        
 C2H3CHO      C2H3CO       CH3COCH3  CH3COCH2   CH3COCH2O  C3H6O1-2          C3H5O
 IC3H5OH      CH3CHCO  ! sheild

!C4                                                  
 C4H2      NC4H3       IC4H3      C4H4       NC4H5      C4H       IC4H5       C4H5-2      C4H6      
 C4H612    C4H6-2      C4H6-1     SAXC4H7    C4H7       C4H7-1    IC4H7       IC4H7-1     C4H7-2     
 CH3CCHCH3 C4H81       C4H82      IC4H8      PC4H9      SC4H9     IC4H9       TC4H9       C4H10      IC4H10    
 H2C4O     C4H7O   IC4H7O    
 IC4H6OH   IC3H5CHO   ! not sub-mech    

!C5
C5H2   C5H3     cC5H4       C5H4       lC5H5      C5H5       C5H6      lC5H7   C5H52
C5H5O13    C5H5O24  C5H4O     C5H5OH      C5H4OH     C5H3O

!C6 
C6H2      C6H3        l-C6H4     o-C6H4          A1-       fulvene   A1     n-C6H5  C5H4CH3
A1O A1OH   P-C6H4O2  O-C6H4O2       OC6H4OH   C6H4OH   cC6H7   lC6H7  A1OO   A1OOH   

CH2CH2CHO    C2H5CHO    C2H5CO 

CC4H8O   IC4H8O    IC3H7CHO    IC3H6CHO  TC3H6CHO     IC4H9O   TC4H9O  IC3H6CO 

END
!----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

REACTIONS

